From: TB520FU <tb520fu@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] ColorDisplayService: adjustable display white balance strength

Settings.Secure display_white_balance_strength (0-100, default 100) pulls the
white balance target CCT towards the nominal white point: 100 keeps the
configured mapping (the stock ZUI one on the TB520FU), lower values make the
tint weaker. Set from TB520FUParts (Lenovo features > Display).

Also define the config_tb520fu_patch_wb_strength framework resource so
TB520FUParts can tell whether this patch is applied.

---
diff --git a/services/core/java/com/android/server/display/color/ColorDisplayService.java b/services/core/java/com/android/server/display/color/ColorDisplayService.java
index ce2fae2ff..bbb750eac 100644
--- a/services/core/java/com/android/server/display/color/ColorDisplayService.java
+++ b/services/core/java/com/android/server/display/color/ColorDisplayService.java
